WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Status colors: same colors, named classes.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.500
Before: diff counts use inline status colors.

00:06.500 --> 00:10.000
After: the same diff colors use named status classes.

00:10.000 --> 00:13.500
Before: a real missing-conversation error toast uses an inline color.

00:13.500 --> 00:17.000
After: the same toast icon uses the status class.

00:17.000 --> 00:20.500
Before: an actual server disconnect shows an inline-colored error icon.

00:20.500 --> 00:24.000
After: the same disconnected error icon uses the status class.

00:24.000 --> 00:26.000
Four inline styles removed. Colors preserved.
